[PlyCount "3"]

{Can you spot a strategic mini-plan for White to gain a large positional edge?} 2. Bh3 {Fighting for the only open file! Such a strong move.} Rxc1+ (2... Rb8 3. Rc7 {The natural result of dominating the open file: the rook invades the 7th rank and White gains a decisive edge with Rac1 to follow.}) 3. Rxc1 {And as a result of this short sequence, White gains a decisive positional advantage as a result of dominating the only open file. Rc7 cannot be stopped now.} *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "????.??.??"]
