{Positional chess often involves helping your pieces. Please find a mini plan for White that will activate a bad piece.} 2. f4 {The only way to fight! The terrible knight on d2 is on the route to e5 right now! White gains equality after this move.} (2. Re1 {is wrong as it ignores the terrible d2 -knight. Now Black will keep that piece buried with} f4 $1 {and f3-f4 & Nf3-e5 plan is prevented. Prophylaxis at its best. Advantage Black!}) 2... Re8 3. Nf3 Re2 4. Re1 *

