1. Nf5 {Hammer - Svidler, 2017.} Bxf5 (1... d5 {does not work due to} 2. exd5 {and the f5 -knight is protected by the queen.}) 2. exf5 d5 {And Black achieves an ideal pawn center as a result of this trade. Together with the backward pawn on c2 , this gives Black a significant advantage.} *

