46... Qe7 {Black covers the check with the queen. What should White do?} 47. h6 {Of course! In the queen endings, it is the quality of the passed pawn rather than the quantity that matters! White's passed pawn reaches the 6th rank, and it becomes unstoppable as the black queen is pinned.} (47. Qxe7+ $4 Kxe7 {And the black king stops the h-pawn. Black was engaging in this 'wishful thinking' while playing 46... Qe7 .}) 47... Qxg7 (47... Kd8 {The black king cannot reach the pawn now:} 48. Qxe7+ Kxe7 49. h7) 48. hxg7 {And the pawn promotes.} *

