{Do you remember the Sam Shankland rule?} 27... b4 {You thought this pawn could not go forward? Think again!} 28. cxb4 c3 {Forking the queen and the knight. Black thus uses tactics to play the positionally desirable move: rolling the queenside pawn majority. See the relevant Theme.} *

