{The black king has been weakened at the cost of a piece sacrifice. What is the only winning sequence for White?} 2. Qg3+ {Getting ready for the following knight discovery.} Kf8 (2... Kh8 3. Nxf7#) (2... Ng4 {is the only way to avoid losing the queen, but it leads to a crushing mating attack:} 3. Qxg4+ Kf8 {and here, among other things, White has an elegant knight sacrifice:} 4. Nxf7 Kxf7 5. Qxe6+ {with a winning attack for White.}) 3. Ng6+ {And the queen on c7 will be taken next move. A useful attacking pattern to remember!} fxg6 4. Qxc7 *

