{The light squares around the black king have been weakened. How should White proceed with the attack from here?} 4. Rxf8+ {Removing the defender and weakening the h7 -square.} (4. Bb1 {was also winning but not as smooth as the game continuation:} Bf6 {the only way to prevent Rxf8} 5. dxe5 {and the bishop is lost as otherwise Rxf8 will lead to mate.} Rxe6 6. exf6 Rxf6 7. Rxf6 gxf6 8. Rd7 {and White wins.}) 4... Bxf8 (4... Rxf8 5. Bb1) 5. Bb1 {Simple and strong. The f8 -knight disappeared and mate will soon follow on h7 .} *

