{Razuvaev - Uhlmann, 1975. Strong attackers never forget about the final piece that should also participate in the attack. What is the strongest continuation for White?} 1. Bd1 {The final piece joins the attack with a decisive effect. Black resigned here, e.g.:} (1. Ba4 {does not win directly due to} b5 {.}) 1... Re8 2. Bf3 {And the upcoming bishop check on d5 will be decisive.} *

