48. f5 {Here Black is facing a daunting task: the h8 -queen is buried and the black king is paralyzed due to the h6 -pawn. Can you spot a good trick to have fighting chances for Black?} Qxf6 {The queen was buried anyways. Just exchange her off for the two rooks!} (48... Rxf6 $2 49. exf6 {This would leave the black queen buried in the corner, and open the e-file for the white rook!} Kf8 50. Qe3 Rd8 51. Qc5+ Kg8 52. Qe7) 49. exf6 (49. Qxf6 {was a better alternative for White:} Rxf6 50. exf6 Kf8 {White still keeps a large advantage in this rook ending, but Black has saving chances if White slips.}) 49... Rxe4 {And Black will surely have saving chances here, due to the two rooks vs. the queen.} *

