{Black has an extra bishop and the white queen is pinned. Should White resign?} 1. Kh4 {An incredible resource! This multi-purpose move unpins the queen and prepares g4 - g5 mate as well as Qh5 mate!} (1. g5+ $4 {This would be a blunder:} Kh5 {and Black wins.}) 1... Qxe6 {Black has no good options.} (1... Be7+ 2. g5+ Bxg5+ 3. Qxg5#) (1... Bxe5 2. g5#) 2. Qh5# {Chess is full of resources indeed!} *

