19. e5 {Fischer played the strongest move in the actual game:} (19. Rf6 $3 Bxf6 20. e5) {The only way to survive.} 19... f5 {The only defense which saves Black. Now the b1 - h7 diagonal is blocked and Black offers a queen trade.} (19... h6 $2 20. exd6 dxc3 21. Qf5 {And White wins due to the big threat of Qh7 mate!}) 20. Qxe8 Nxe8 {An elegant defensive resource! (See the relevant Defensive Theme. )} *

