{How did AlphaZero produce a positional masterpiece from this position against Stockfish?} 13. Qh4 {Hitting the e7 -rook but the real idea is devilish:} Rde8 (13... Qe5 $2 {Black cannot save the queen:} 14. Re3 $1 {And the e7 -rook will be taken next move.}) 14. Rf6 {Burying the queen on h8 ! Such beauty! AlphaZero converted easily from this position. See the relevant Positional Theme.} *

