{What is our goal in this position?} 26. Nd8 {Nice goal-setting! White is playing for a draw and achieves it in a forcing way.} Rf8 {The black rook has no other square:} (26... Rd7 $2 27. Nxf6+ {and White wins.}) (26... Rh7 27. Nxf6+ {and White wins}) (26... Rg7 27. Nxf6+ Kf8 28. Ne6+ {and White wins.}) 27. Ne6 {Forcing the initial position!} Rf7 28. Nd8 {Black had no choice. An instructive 3-ply calculation to achieve the goal from the initial position. See the relevant Theme.} *

