1. Rc7 {White could win without any complications after the queen trade:} (1. Qxd7 Rxd7 2. Kf1 {Keep it simple in winning positions!}) {White expects instant resignation. Should Black concur?} 1... Rc5 {It is White who should resign now!} 2. dxc5 (2. Rxd7 Rc1#) (2. Rxc5 Qxb7) 2... Qd1# {If a move looks winning instantly, we should slow down and really double-check everything before we execute the move. See the relevant Defensive Theme.} *

